{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Propagate fatal failures during MDC capture.** A `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` from `restoreMdcOnClose()`\u2014including through a standard completion wrapper\u2014is passed to `finishInvocation` and converted into terminal `FAILED`, even though invocation start and user code never ran. Re-throw lifecycle fatals before invoking the initialization-failure callback, and add direct and wrapped fatal-capture tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77H7R9","finding_digest":"7b38c26004ee57d3ea78863798b3572abf29155ec2abc35fe593e552386356ed","finding_id":"arf_v1_pm4meyae5zl5h2tyqy3zrm2xfk","finding_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-fatal-demotion","identity_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-fatal-demotion","line":249,"observation_digest":"c0ec7c27fde27ecb65da56162f457100dc7be6396a1ae4cc73cda38a224f2b15","observation_id":"aro_v1_ydwhyj754j7mwzo2kylc6rlrad","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_pm4meyae5zl5h2tyqy3zrm2xfk","published_at":"2026-10-07T23:45:40Z","review_id":"arr_v1_rm5dseymedfh2th2cv75hdny2w","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"8c7d121baf431c6e6ce9334d545ba4add75ae26e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":246,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_gptv2bh267s65kq2l3alt37pft"},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_gsswx42t2lub43zd7l23ajcrbo","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T23:45:40Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
